# Every variable floppy's bots read, by name only. Copy this file to .env and
# write each value after the name (NAME=VALUE), or leave a name bare to take
# it from the calling shell (a bare name the shell does not set is skipped).
# Pass the file to scx run with --env-file .env, and never commit .env.
# docs/defaults.md says which document reads each variable.

# The generate service's model endpoint: an OpenAI-compatible base URL (for
# example a vLLM server's /v1) and its key. Both are required; there is no
# default backend (decision D31); the lab's is https://api.willen.dev/v1,
# which serves the default model, gemma-4-26b-a4b (decision D260). Read by
# the builder and by the floppy bot's reasoning, reading and seeing.
FLOPPY_BASE_URL
FLOPPY_API_KEY

# The model endpoint of reflection, learning, revision and the builder they
# invoke, when the bot's reflection_model is not null (decision D260; the
# floppy bot's default is sparks/qwen3.8-flash-next, so the lab's is the CPA
# gateway, https://cpa.willen.dev/v1). The builder run on its own uses
# FLOPPY_BASE_URL.
FLOPPY_REFLECTION_BASE_URL
FLOPPY_REFLECTION_API_KEY

# Whether that endpoint streams its replies: true or false. Unset, no call is
# streamed. With true, reasoning's, reflection's and the builder's calls ask
# for a streamed reply, and each is bounded by inactivity once it streams
# (decision D101); set it only for a backend that streams (a vLLM server
# does; a gateway that answers a streamed request with keep-alive comments
# only does not). Anything but true or false is sent as it is, and the
# backend refuses the request.
FLOPPY_STREAM

# The decision service (TypeSafe), read by the builder's triage and the
# floppy bot's intuition. The floppy bot needs the key (without it every turn
# fails); the builder triages with its fallback. Without a base URL the
# service uses its declared origin, https://api.typesafe.ai.
TYPESAFE_BASE_URL
TYPESAFE_API_KEY

# The speech service's speech endpoint: an OpenAI-compatible audio API
# (/audio/transcriptions and /audio/speech) and its key, for the floppy
# bot's speech decoding (listening) and speech encoding (speaking). No
# default backend; the lab's is https://api.willen.dev/v1 with one of its
# bearer keys (decision D244).
FLOPPY_SPEECH_BASE_URL
FLOPPY_SPEECH_API_KEY

# The speech service's voice endpoint: LocalAI's voice APIs (/vad,
# /audio/diarization, /voice/embed) and its key, for the floppy bot's voice
# detection, diarization and voice identification (listening). No default
# backend; the lab's is https://api.willen.dev/v1, as for speech.
FLOPPY_VOICE_BASE_URL
FLOPPY_VOICE_API_KEY

# The speech service's emotion endpoint: a speech server's emotion API
# (/emotion, emotion2vec+) and its key, for the tone the floppy bot hears in
# decoded speech (listening's voice_affect). No default backend; the lab's
# is https://api.willen.dev/emotion/v1 with one of its bearer keys (decision
# D247). Without it decoded speech carries no tone.
FLOPPY_EMOTION_BASE_URL
FLOPPY_EMOTION_API_KEY
# The generate service's embeddings endpoint (/embeddings, OpenAI's shape) and
# its key, for the episodes the floppy bot recalls by what was said (reflection
# embeds each episode's words, reasoning the turn's cue; embeddinggemma-2 at 256
# dimensions). No default backend; the lab's is https://api.willen.dev/v1 with
# one of its bearer keys (decision D256). Without it recall is by recency.
FLOPPY_EMBEDDING_BASE_URL
FLOPPY_EMBEDDING_API_KEY
